<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Mindweave</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Neural threads extend through the helm, linking the wearer's mind
to the Chrysalis.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Recipe ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 35)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      head (must be equipped)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x2), mutation catalyst (x2),
                binding paste (x2)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Time:</ansi>        7 rounds
  <ansi fg="yellow">Reserve:</ansi>     conviction (1% at tier 0, scaling with tier)

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effect ━━━</ansi>

Increases willpower.

The enchantment grows stronger through combat use, advancing
through five tiers of increasing power and reserve cost.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help enchanting</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>
